From: Ashwin Devi Srinivasan <ashwin@ashds.dev>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:19:54 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Use the built-in short video mode on surya

Surya inherits Karna's choice of MiLive for short video. MiLive records
through a native library in a split downloaded at runtime, and with the
Codec2 encoder that library never writes a video track, so recording
stops at once. Select the Fun short video mode instead, which records
through MediaCodec and MediaMuxer in the app itself.
---
 smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Karna.smali | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Karna.smali b/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Karna.smali
index 3c1b0a2..7e4d9f1 100644
--- a/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Karna.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Karna.smali
@@ -236,7 +236,7 @@
 .method public o000O0o()I
     .locals 0
 
-    const/4 p0, 0x2
+    const/4 p0, 0x0
 
     return p0
 .end method
